Floor objects in demo_objects.sdf
================================

Source: https://github.com/osrf/gazebo_models
Pinned commit: 8163eb4b5e7e21985c6591d1c0bfb56468c0093f
Model directories: cafe_table, cardboard_box, construction_cone.
Authors from model.config:
  cafe_table: Nate Koenig.
  cardboard_box: Nate Koenig and Cole Biesemeyer.
  construction_cone: Cole Biesemeyer and Nate Koenig.
Repository license: Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported.
See LICENSE.floor_objects for the upstream license notice.

Model files, meshes and textures were downloaded individually from the pinned
GitHub revision without cloning. Downloads were verified against upstream Git
blob hashes. The cafe_table and cardboard_box DAE image paths are changed from
bare filenames to ../materials/textures/<filename> for Fortress resource
resolution. Geometry, textures and the remaining model files are unchanged.

demo_objects.sdf adds two instances of each model. Each include sets static=true
and places the model on the floor. Cardboard box centres are at z=0.15 m;
the table and cone model origins are at floor level (z=0).
The original room and three person_standing instances are preserved.
Saved occupancy maps have not been regenerated.
